---
import '../styles/global.css'; 
---

<html lang="it">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>Il mio CV - Christian Mattiolo</title>
  </head>
  
  <body class="bg-linear-to-br from-amber-400 via-orange-500 to-rose-500 min-h-screen p-4 md:p-8 font-sans antialiased flex items-center justify-center">
    
    <main class="max-w-5xl w-full mx-auto bg-white/70 backdrop-blur-xl border border-white/30 shadow-2xl rounded-3xl overflow-hidden ring-1 ring-white/40">
      
		<header class="bg-linear-to-r from-orange-500/90 to-red-600/90 p-8 md:p-12 text-white relative">
			<div class="absolute top-0 right-0 w-40 h-40 bg-white/20 rounded-full blur-3xl pointer-events-none"></div>
		
			<h1 class="text-4xl md:text-6xl font-extrabold tracking-tight drop-shadow-sm relative z-10">Christian Mattiolo</h1>
			<p class="text-xl mt-2 text-orange-100 font-medium relative z-10">Studente / Aspirante Sviluppatore</p>
			
			<div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap gap-3 text-sm font-medium items-center relative z-10">
			  
			  <a href="https://www.google.it/maps/place/47025+Mercato+Saraceno+FC" target="_blank"  class="bg-white/20 hover:bg-white/30 border border-white/20 backdrop-blur-md px-4 py-2 rounded-full transition-all duration-300 cursor-pointer inline-flex items-center gap-2 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md hover:-translate-y-0.5">
				  <span>📍</span> Mercato Saraceno
			  </a>
		
			  <a href="tel:+393923651045" class="bg-white/20 hover:bg-white/30 border border-white/20 backdrop-blur-md px-4 py-2 rounded-full transition-all duration-300 cursor-pointer inline-flex items-center gap-2 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md hover:-translate-y-0.5">
				<span>📞</span> +39 3923651045
			  </a>
			  
			  <div class="relative group inline-block">
				<span class="bg-white/20 hover:bg-white/30 border border-white/20 backdrop-blur-md px-4 py-2 rounded-full transition-all duration-300 cursor-pointer inline-flex items-center gap-2 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md hover:-translate-y-0.5">
				  <span>📧</span> christianmattiolo@email.com ▾
				</span>
			  
				<div class="absolute left-0 top-full pt-3 w-56 opacity-0 invisible group-hover:opacity-100 group-hover:visible transition-all duration-300 z-50 transform origin-top-left group-hover:scale-100 scale-95">
				  <div class="bg-white/90 backdrop-blur-2xl border border-white/40 rounded-2xl shadow-2xl p-2 flex flex-col gap-1 ring-1 ring-black/5">
			  
					<a href="mailto:christianmattiolo@email.com" class="text-sm text-slate-700 hover:bg-orange-500/10 hover:text-orange-700 px-3 py-2 rounded-xl transition-colors flex items-center gap-2">
					  📱 Apri App predefinita
					</a>
					
					<a href="https://mail.google.com/mail/?view=cm&fs=1&to=christianmattiolo@email.com" target="_blank" class="text-sm text-slate-700 hover:bg-orange-500/10 hover:text-orange-700 px-3 py-2 rounded-xl transition-colors flex items-center gap-2">
					  🌐 Apri Gmail (Browser)
					</a>
			  
				  </div>
				</div>
			  </div>
		
			  <a href="https://github.com/SleepySmiley" target="_blank" class="bg-white/20 hover:bg-white/30 border border-white/20 backdrop-blur-md px-4 py-2 rounded-full transition-all duration-300 cursor-pointer inline-flex items-center gap-2 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md hover:-translate-y-0.5">
  <svg class="w-5 h-5 fill-current" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true">
    <path d="M12 0c-6.626 0-12 5.373-12 12 0 5.302 3.438 9.8 8.207 11.387.599.111.793-.261.793-.577v-2.234c-3.338.726-4.042-1.416-4.042-1.416-.546-1.387-1.333-1.756-1.333-1.756-1.089-.744.083-.729.083-.729 1.205.084 1.839 1.237 1.839 1.237 1.07 1.834 2.807 1.304 3.492.997.107-.775.418-1.305.762-1.604-2.665-.305-5.467-1.334-5.467-5.931 0-1.311.469-2.381 1.236-3.221-.124-.303-.535-1.524.117-3.176 0 0 1.008-.322 3.301 1.23.957-.266 1.983-.399 3.003-.404 1.02.005 2.047.138 3.006.404 2.291-1.552 3.297-1.23 3.297-1.23.653 1.653.242 2.874.118 3.176.77.84 1.235 1.911 1.235 3.221 0 4.609-2.807 5.624-5.479 5.921.43.372.823 1.102.823 2.222v3.293c0 .319.192.694.801.576 4.765-1.589 8.199-6.086 8.199-11.386 0-6.627-5.373-12-12-12z"></path>
  </svg>
  <span>SleepySmiley</span>
</a>
		
			</div>
		</header>

      <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row">
        
        <aside class="w-full md:w-[35%] bg-white/40 p-8 md:p-10 border-r border-white/30 backdrop-blur-lg">
          
          <h2 class="text-xs font-bold text-red-900/60 mb-4 uppercase tracking-widest">Chi sono</h2>
          <p class="text-base text-slate-800 mb-10 leading-relaxed font-medium">
            Ho 17 anni e una passione per l'informatica e i mondi affini a questo. Insieme a questa passione produco anche musica e ho fatto fotografia.
          </p>

          <h2 class="text-xs font-bold text-red-900/60 mb-4 uppercase tracking-widest">Competenze</h2>
          <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
            <span class="bg-white/50 border border-white/40 text-slate-700 text-xs font-bold px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg shadow-sm backdrop-blur-md">HTML</span>
            <span class="bg-white/50 border border-white/40 text-slate-700 text-xs font-bold px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg shadow-sm backdrop-blur-md">CSS</span>
            <span class="bg-white/50 border border-white/40 text-slate-700 text-xs font-bold px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg shadow-sm backdrop-blur-md">Tailwind V4</span>
            <span class="bg-white/50 border border-white/40 text-slate-700 text-xs font-bold px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg shadow-sm backdrop-blur-md">Astro</span>
          </div>
        </aside>

        <section class="w-full md:w-[65%] p-8 md:p-12 bg-white/60 backdrop-blur-lg">
          
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-8 flex items-center gap-3">
            <span class="flex h-8 w-8 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-orange-100/80 ring-4 ring-orange-50/50">🚀</span>
            Esperienza
          </h2>
          
          <div class="mb-8 group rounded-2xl bg-white/40 p-6 border border-white/40 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-all hover:bg-white/60 backdrop-blur-md">
            <div class="flex justify-between items-baseline mb-2">
              <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-800 group-hover:text-orange-600 transition-colors">Sito CV Personale</h3>
              <span class="text-xs font-bold text-orange-700 bg-orange-100/50 border border-orange-200/50 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full backdrop-blur-md">2026 - Presente</span>
            </div>
            <p class="text-slate-500 font-medium text-sm mb-3 flex items-center gap-1">
              <span>✨</span> Progetto Indipendente
            </p>
            <p class="text-slate-700 text-sm leading-relaxed">
              Progettazione e sviluppo di un curriculum web con design <span class="font-semibold text-orange-600">Glassmorphism</span>. Implementazione dell'architettura con Astro e styling avanzato con Tailwind CSS v4, utilizzando backdrop-filters e gradienti complessi.
            </p>
          </div>

          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-8 mt-12 flex items-center gap-3">
             <span class="flex h-8 w-8 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-orange-100/80 ring-4 ring-orange-50/50">🎓</span>
            Istruzione
          </h2>
          
          <div class="rounded-2xl bg-white/40 p-6 border border-white/40 shadow-sm backdrop-blur-md">
            <div class="flex justify-between items-baseline mb-2">
              <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-800">Scuola Superiore</h3>
              <span class="text-xs font-bold text-slate-600 bg-slate-100/50 border border-slate-200/50 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full backdrop-blur-md">2022 - 2027</span>
            </div>
            <p class="text-slate-700 font-medium text-base flex items-center gap-2">
              🏫 ITI Blaise Pascal Comandini
            </p>
          </div>

        </section>
      </div>
    </main>

  </body>
</html>